    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 27(1) of the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978, I, Dr. WijayadasaRajapaksa, Minister of Higher Education and Cultural Affairs, on the recommendation of the University Grants Commission,do by this Order, amend the Schedule to the Order made under Section 21 of the said Act, published in GazetteExtraordinary No. 896/2 of November 07, 1995 (as last amended by Order published in the Gazette Extraordinary,No. 2037/ 15 of September 21, 2017), which specifies the Faculties and Departments of the Raja Rata University ofSri Lanka, as follows :-",
